        <title type="html"><![CDATA[ci(pr-review-companion): identify PR via GitHub API]]></title>
        <id>https://github.com/mdn/content/pull/43072</id>
        <link href="https://github.com/mdn/content/pull/43072"/>
        <updated>2026-02-09T19:55:56.000Z</updated>
        <content type="html"><![CDATA[<img src="https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/495429?u=2f3b9dd03c6c4a961d44a632fe1976c73fa19e1f&v=4" width="64" height="64" alt=""/><br/><h3 dir="auto">Description</h3>
<p dir="auto">Refines the <code class="notranslate">pr-review-companion</code> workflow:</p>
<ol dir="auto">
<li>Identifies the PR number via the GitHub API, instead of using the <code class="notranslate">NR</code> file in the build artifact.</li>
<li>Reports the review deployment status on fork PRs as well, using the <code class="notranslate">head_sha</code> from the <code class="notranslate">workflow_run</code> payload.</li>
</ol>
<h3 dir="auto">Motivation</h3>
<ol dir="auto">
<li>Improve the security of the workflow.</li>
<li>Make review deployment status visible on fork PRs.</li>
</ol>
<h3 dir="auto">Additional details</h3>

<h3 dir="auto">Related issues and pull requests</h3>
<p dir="auto">Same approach as in Fred:</p>
